* cwht receiver front-end band-pass filter, sections 2+3+3, stray input-to-output capacitance CST stepped per section, coil Q 100
* Generated by hardware/sim/rx-frontend/make_decks.py (do not edit by hand). LTspice 26.0.2 via tools/ltspice-batch.sh.
* Topology: shunt parallel-LC resonators, top-C coupling, series-C end coupling (bpf_design.py).
* Resonator L 56 nH; coil Q QU (stepped or fixed); capacitor Q 500 (estimate); ground via 5nH per resonator.

.param QU=100 QC=500 LVIA=5n
* The stray path is driven by an ideal copy of the section input voltage times SGN (+1 or -1), so each
* stray value is run with both phases of the leakage relative to the filter path (a leak of unknown phase).
.step param CST list 0.003p 0.01p 0.03p 0.1p
.step param SGN list -1 1
V1 s1 0 AC 2
R1s s1 i1 50
R1l o1 0 50
* b1: 2-resonator top-C coupled, design BW 6.00 MHz, ripple 0.1 dB, L 56 nH
Cb1sin i1 b1r1 4.8666p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.866626e-12*QC)}
Lb11 b1r1 b1g1 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb1sh1 b1r1 b1g1 15.3838p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.538377e-11*QC)}
Lb1v1 b1g1 0 {LVIA}
Cb1k1 b1r1 b1r2 1.2046p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.204578e-12*QC)}
Lb12 b1r2 b1g2 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb1sh2 b1r2 b1g2 15.3838p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.538377e-11*QC)}
Lb1v2 b1g2 0 {LVIA}
Cb1sout b1r2 o1 4.8666p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.866626e-12*QC)}
Est1 x1 0 i1 0 {SGN}
Cst1 x1 o1 {CST}
V2 s2 0 AC 2
R2s s2 i2 50
R2l o2 0 50
* b2: 3-resonator top-C coupled, design BW 6.00 MHz, ripple 0.1 dB, L 56 nH
Cb2sin i2 b2r1 4.3796p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.379646e-12*QC)}
Lb21 b2r1 b2g1 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb2sh1 b2r1 b2g1 16.2125p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.621246e-11*QC)}
Lb2v1 b2g1 0 {LVIA}
Cb2k1 b2r1 b2r2 0.8018p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*8.017836e-13*QC)}
Lb22 b2r2 b2g2 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb2sh2 b2r2 b2g2 19.6205p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.962047e-11*QC)}
Lb2v2 b2g2 0 {LVIA}
Cb2k2 b2r2 b2r3 0.8018p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*8.017836e-13*QC)}
Lb23 b2r3 b2g3 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb2sh3 b2r3 b2g3 16.2125p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.621246e-11*QC)}
Lb2v3 b2g3 0 {LVIA}
Cb2sout b2r3 o2 4.3796p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.379646e-12*QC)}
Est2 x2 0 i2 0 {SGN}
Cst2 x2 o2 {CST}
V3 s3 0 AC 2
R3s s3 i3 50
R3l o3 0 50
* b3: 3-resonator top-C coupled, design BW 6.00 MHz, ripple 0.1 dB, L 56 nH
Cb3sin i3 b3r1 4.3796p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.379646e-12*QC)}
Lb31 b3r1 b3g1 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb3sh1 b3r1 b3g1 16.2125p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.621246e-11*QC)}
Lb3v1 b3g1 0 {LVIA}
Cb3k1 b3r1 b3r2 0.8018p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*8.017836e-13*QC)}
Lb32 b3r2 b3g2 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb3sh2 b3r2 b3g2 19.6205p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.962047e-11*QC)}
Lb3v2 b3g2 0 {LVIA}
Cb3k2 b3r2 b3r3 0.8018p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*8.017836e-13*QC)}
Lb33 b3r3 b3g3 56.0000n Rser={2*pi*1.45986e+08*5.600000e-08/QU}
Cb3sh3 b3r3 b3g3 16.2125p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*1.621246e-11*QC)}
Lb3v3 b3g3 0 {LVIA}
Cb3sout b3r3 o3 4.3796p Rser={1/(2*pi*1.45986e+08*4.379646e-12*QC)}
Est3 x3 0 i3 0 {SGN}
Cst3 x3 o3 {CST}
.ac lin 721 118Meg 154Meg
.save V(o1) V(o2) V(o3)
.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=15
.end
